1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:05,070
Pulling a banknote from a wallet looks easy, until a robot tries.
从钱包抽出纸币，对机器人并不简单。

2
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:08,530
The fingers must pinch a thin edge without pushing it away.
指尖必须捏住薄边，不能把它推走。

3
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:13,030
DexPilot asks whether a person can guide that contact using bare hands.
DexPilot让人用裸手引导这次接触。

4
00:00:13,579 --> 00:00:19,059
Four depth cameras observe the operator, producing a fused three-dimensional point cloud.
四台深度相机融合出三维点云。

5
00:00:19,539 --> 00:00:23,559
Neural networks locate the hand and provide keypoints and joint-angle priors.
网络定位人手，给出关键点和关节先验。

6
00:00:23,919 --> 00:00:27,719
A model-based tracker then fits an articulated hand to those observations.
模型跟踪器再把关节手模型拟合到观测。

7
00:00:28,485 --> 00:00:33,565
Human fingers and Allegro fingers have different proportions and different motion limits.
人手和Allegro的比例与运动范围不同。

8
00:00:34,025 --> 00:00:39,405
So an optimizer matches relationships between fingertips, rather than copying every angle.
优化器匹配指尖关系，而非照搬关节角。

9
00:00:39,825 --> 00:00:44,845
Nearby fingertips receive special treatment, helping the robot preserve a useful pinch.
临近指尖被特殊处理，以保留有效捏合。

10
00:00:45,438 --> 00:00:50,878
The architecture separates learned perception, model tracking, and the robot control loop.
架构分开处理感知、模型跟踪和机器人控制。

11
00:00:51,358 --> 00:00:55,378
Hand targets feed arm motion generation and impedance control for execution.
人手目标进入手臂运动生成与阻抗控制。

12
00:00:55,878 --> 00:00:59,578
The paper reports roughly one second across the complete system chain.
论文报告整条系统链约有一秒延迟。

13
00:01:00,089 --> 00:01:05,069
Bare-hand operation does not mean the perception model learned without labeled examples.
裸手操作不等于模型没有使用标注训练。

14
00:01:05,529 --> 00:01:10,049
A colored glove helped initialize tracking and generate labels during data collection.
采集时，彩色手套辅助初始化与标签生成。

15
00:01:10,329 --> 00:01:14,729
Those tracked poses supervise a second stage that works on bare-hand point clouds.
这些姿态再监督处理裸手点云的第二阶段。

16
00:01:15,378 --> 00:01:22,058
Two trained operators attempted fifteen teleoperation tasks, with five consecutive trials per task.
两名熟练操作者测试15项任务，各连续五次。

17
00:01:22,178 --> 00:01:27,298
The plots measure task success and completion time, not fingertip localization error.
图表统计成功率与耗时，不是指尖定位误差。

18
00:01:27,518 --> 00:01:31,578
The human still chooses actions and reacts when a manipulation starts failing.
动作选择和失败应对仍由操作者完成。

19
00:01:32,140 --> 00:01:36,440
The paper mentions insertion with a clearance of one tenth of a millimeter.
论文提到过间隙0.1毫米的插入。

20
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:40,940
But success was typically around ten percent and depended on initial placement.
但通常成功率约10%，且依赖初始摆放。

21
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:46,980
That example cannot establish reliable submillimeter positioning for the complete robot system.
这一案例不能证明系统具有稳定亚毫米精度。

22
00:01:47,621 --> 00:01:53,181
DexPilot shows why good hand tracking still needs contact-aware mapping and human feedback.
DexPilot说明，追踪还需要接触映射与人反馈。

23
00:01:53,561 --> 00:01:58,541
It offers a practical route to demonstrations, while autonomous recovery remains separate.
它提供示教采集路线，自主恢复是另一问题。

24
00:01:58,861 --> 00:02:04,021
For precision work, judge the whole loop: observation, mapping, contact, and recovery.
精细操作要看观测、映射、接触和恢复全链路。
